    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 23 Grange Heights is a spacious three bed, two bath family home situated in the sought after residential estate of Grange Heights, just off Johns Hill in Waterford city. This superb home is tastefully decorated throughout and in walk in condition with the benefit of new double glazing windows & doors. The property comprises of entrance hall, living room, spacious sitting room, kitchen/diner, and shower room with wc. \nThe first floor has two double bedrooms, one single bedroom and main bathroom / shower room. \nThis property would make an excellent family home given its prime location with all modern conviences on your door step. \nThe property has the benefit of gas fired central heating, uPVC double glazing throughout and uPVC fascia & soffits.\n\nLOCATION\nThe property is situated within easy walking distance of a choice of local amenities such as St. Anne's Tennis Club, the People's Park, and a range of excellent primary and post-primary schools including St. John of Gods, Newtown, Christchurch, De La Salle and Waterpark. The property is a short walk to the City Centre, Ardkeen Shopping Centre, University Hospital Waterford, and Tesco Ardkeen shopping centre. The area is serviced by a regular bus routes to and from the city centre and onwards via bus and rail links. SETU (Southeast Technical University) is within a short driving distance or by bus connection. \n\nGARDEN\nFront garden in lawn with driveway with off street parking. Rear garden has a sunny westerly facing garden with manicured lawns, patio and mature shubbery.\n\nASKING PRICE 385,000\n\nFor further information and viewing arrangements please contact DNG Reid & Coppinger 051852233"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.92 x 2.27\nTimber flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 3.50 x 4.28\nCast iron open fireplace. Coving to ceiling. Venetian blinds to window.\n\nOpen Plan Sitting Room/Dining Room - 3.02 x 6.62\nTimber flooring. Open fireplace with woodburning stove. Double doors to rear patio and garden. Coving to ceiling. Blinds to window.\n\nKitchen - 5.40 x 2.64\nTiled flooring. Fitted kitchen with granite worktops. Breakfast bar. Recess lighting. Door to rear garden. Blind to window.\n\nShower Room - 1.72 x 2.73\nTiled flooring and walls to ceiling. WC, WHB with vanity unit. Walk in shower. Recess lights. Venetian blinds to window.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.45 x 3.82\nTimber flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Venetian blinds to window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.97 x 3.78\nTimber floring. Sliderobes. Blinds to window.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.04 x 2.74\nTimber flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Venetian blinds to window.\n\nShower Room - 1.67 x 2.73\nTiled flooring and walls to ceiling. WC, WHB, electric T90 shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Excellent location.</li><li> Sunny Westerly Facing Rear Garden.</li><li> New uPVC Double Glazed Windows.</li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li> New composite front door.</li><li> PVC Facia and Soffits</li><li> Stira to attic.</ul>"
